{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978440/extras/dcb63e2b5a4a6d7bde456327f534801e.poster.avif?t=1757990498\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978440/extras/dcb63e2b5a4a6d7bde456327f534801e.webm?t=1757990498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978440/extras/dcb63e2b5a4a6d7bde456327f534801e.mp4?t=1757990498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your new plump, winged friends!<br>This free DLC, created to thank you for all the love and support you\u2019ve shown,<br>adds 5 new bird characters to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like other characters, bird characters can visit your hot spring as guests or be hired as staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chick: Known for its yellow, plump body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparrow: A cute little bird, especially when huddled together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied Tit: A bold bird with striking brown and black patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-tailed Tit: Its snow-white feathers give it a charming look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairy Wren: A beautiful bird with striking blue feathers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No additional steps required \u2014 simply launch the game with the DLC installed, and the content will be applied automatically.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978440?t=1757990498","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978440?t=1757990498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta