n huddled together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied Tit: A bold bird with striking brown and black patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-tailed Tit: Its snow-white feathers give it a charming look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairy Wren: A beautiful bird with striking blue feathers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No additional steps required \u2014 simply launch the game with the DLC installed, and the content will be applied automatically.</i></p>","developers":["Sinkhole Studio","Moonlab Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3404470","name":"Maltese's Fluffy Onsen"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978440/3e6e80824040f0fecf0560c2d6333c626a982386/header.jpg?t=1757990498","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 11.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,6 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Maltese's Fluffy Onsen - Bird DLC","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sinkhole Studio","Paleo","XD"],"ratings":{"cadpa":{"rating":"8"},"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_ge